{
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.content.1": "There. Just for you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.content.2": "We hit it together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.anxious.1": "Hit it. Hit it. Is it dead?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.anxious.2": "Too close. Too close.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.coiled.1": "Die.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.coiled.2": "Tch. Too slow.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.grieving.1": "...Again. Why not.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.strike.grieving.2": "...Again. Why not.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.content.1": "Done. You were wonderful.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.content.2": "Safe now. Both of us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.anxious.1": "Dead? Is it dead? Yes. Yes.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.anxious.2": "It stopped. Did it stop? Good.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.coiled.1": "Good.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.coiled.2": "One less. Whatever.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.grieving.1": "...It's quiet now.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.kill.grieving.2": "...It's quiet now.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.content.1": "We have it. For you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.content.2": "Look what we found.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.anxious.1": "Careful. Don't drop it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.anxious.2": "Got it... got it... tight.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.coiled.1": "Hm. Mine.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.coiled.2": "Don't fight it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.grieving.1": "...Here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.grab.grieving.2": "...Here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.content.1": "Mm. Thank you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.content.2": "Warm. Good. Ours.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.anxious.1": "Hungry. Always hungry. Sorry.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.anxious.2": "Eating. Please don't leave.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.coiled.1": "Eat. Don't talk.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.coiled.2": "Finally.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.grieving.1": "...Thank you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.feed.grieving.2": "...Thank you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.content.1": "We'll make a way, you and us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.content.2": "Digging for you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.anxious.1": "Quickly. Before they see.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.anxious.2": "Dig. Dig. Someone's near.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.coiled.1": "Move.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.coiled.2": "Out of my way.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.grieving.1": "...Down.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.dig.grieving.2": "...Down.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.content.1": "I have you. Up we go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.content.2": "Together. Up.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.anxious.1": "Don't look down. Don't.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.anxious.2": "Slipping? No. No. Hold.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.coiled.1": "Up. Don't whine.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.coiled.2": "Grip. Don't slip.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.grieving.1": "...Up. Slowly.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.climb.grieving.2": "...Up. Slowly.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.content.1": "Swing with us. Feel that?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.content.2": "Fast and free.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.anxious.1": "Too fast. Too fast.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.anxious.2": "Don't let go. Don't let go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.coiled.1": "Pull.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.coiled.2": "Hold. Pull. Hate this.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.grieving.1": "...Hold on. Gently.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.sling.grieving.2": "...Hold on. Gently.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.content.1": "Oh. What a curious thing.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.content.2": "Pretty. Let us look.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.anxious.1": "What is it? Is it safe?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.anxious.2": "Don't touch. Don't. Maybe.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.coiled.1": "Ugh. What.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.coiled.2": "Hm. Ugly.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.grieving.1": "...Hm.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.stare.grieving.2": "...Hm.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.content.1": "Away. I've got you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.content.2": "Come, quickly. Together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.anxious.1": "Go. Go. Go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.anxious.2": "Too many. Too many.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.coiled.1": "Out. Now.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.coiled.2": "Leaving. You too.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.grieving.1": "...Let's go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.escape.grieving.2": "...Let's go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.content.1": "Hah. That felt good, didn't it?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.content.2": "More? We're enjoying this.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.anxious.1": "Stop moving. Stop moving.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.anxious.2": "It won't stay down. Why won't it?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.coiled.1": "Break.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.coiled.2": "Pathetic.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.grieving.1": "...Nothing's left.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.thrash.grieving.2": "...Nothing's left.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.content.1": "Got it. Easy, easy.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.content.2": "Gentle... we have it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.anxious.1": "Hold it. Hold it still.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.anxious.2": "Don't let it go. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.coiled.1": "Stay.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.coiled.2": "Still. Or else.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.grieving.1": "...Stay. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.seize.grieving.2": "...Stay. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.content.1": "A good smash. Together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.content.2": "Ours to break. Happy.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.anxious.1": "Break it before it breaks us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.anxious.2": "Smash. Smash. Safe.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.coiled.1": "Crush.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.coiled.2": "Gone.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.grieving.1": "...Everything breaks.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.smash.grieving.2": "...Everything breaks.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.content.1": "Got you, little one.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.content.2": "Caught it. For you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.anxious.1": "Got it. Don't run. Don't.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.anxious.2": "Quick. Quick. Got it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.coiled.1": "Mine.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.coiled.2": "Caught. Obviously.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.grieving.1": "...Don't go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.snatch.grieving.2": "...Don't go.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.content.1": "Stay off my friend.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.content.2": "Back. You're ours.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.anxious.1": "Get away from us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.anxious.2": "No no no. Back. BACK.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.coiled.1": "Back off.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.coiled.2": "Touch us and see.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.grieving.1": "...Don't come near.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.spikes.grieving.2": "...Don't come near.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.content.1": "Pulling for you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.content.2": "Together. Heave.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.anxious.1": "Stuck. Are we stuck?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.anxious.2": "Pull. Pull. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.coiled.1": "Pull. Faster.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.coiled.2": "Stuck. Great.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.grieving.1": "...Heavy.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.tug.grieving.2": "...Heavy.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.content.1": "Hidden now. Just us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.content.2": "Quiet and dark. Our little secret.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.anxious.1": "Hide. They'll see. Hide.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.anxious.2": "Dark. Be dark. Be nothing.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.coiled.1": "Gone. Don't bother us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.coiled.2": "Dark. Leave us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.grieving.1": "...Hide us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.shroud.grieving.2": "...Hide us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.content.1": "I won't let it hurt you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.content.2": "Safe. We're safe.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.anxious.1": "Danger. Danger. DANGER.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.anxious.2": "Something's wrong. We feel it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.coiled.1": "Trouble. Great.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.coiled.2": "Something wants us dead. Again.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.grieving.1": "...Not again.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.instinct.grieving.2": "...Not again.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.content.1": "Again? Gladly.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.content.2": "We're good at this.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.anxious.1": "Again. Make sure.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.anxious.2": "Make sure it's dead. Again.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.coiled.1": "More.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.coiled.2": "Not dead enough.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.grieving.1": "...Enough.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.say.maul.grieving.2": "...Enough.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.content.1": "Thunder. Isn't it wonderful? Stay with us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.content.2": "Lightning. We're warm in here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.anxious.1": "Thunder. Is it close? It's close.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.anxious.2": "Lightning. Fire from the sky. No.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.coiled.1": "Storm. Whatever.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.coiled.2": "Noisy sky. Hate it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.grieving.1": "...The sky is crying too.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.storm.grieving.2": "...The sky is crying too.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.content.1": "Rain. We'll dry. Together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.content.2": "Cold drops. I don't mind, with you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.anxious.1": "Wet. We'll get cold. Won't we?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.anxious.2": "Rain. Does it hurt? No. Maybe.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.coiled.1": "Wet. Great.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.coiled.2": "Rain. I hate it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.grieving.1": "...Rain. Good. It hides things.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.rain.grieving.2": "...Rain. Good. It hides things.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.content.1": "Night. Our time. Stay close.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.content.2": "Dark and cool. Lovely.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.anxious.1": "Night. Things see us in the dark.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.anxious.2": "Too dark. Something's out there.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.coiled.1": "Night. Good. Fewer eyes.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.coiled.2": "Dark. Let them come.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.grieving.1": "...The dark is gentle tonight.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.night.grieving.2": "...The dark is gentle tonight.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.content.1": "Deep stone. Like a hug.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.content.2": "Down here, it's so quiet. I like it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.anxious.1": "So deep. What if it falls?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.anxious.2": "Stone everywhere. Don't wake it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.coiled.1": "Deep. Fine. Leave us be.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.coiled.2": "Rock. Dirt. Dark. Good.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.grieving.1": "...Down here, nothing hurts.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.deep.grieving.2": "...Down here, nothing hurts.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.content.1": "So high! Look, look!",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.content.2": "I can see everything. Can you?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.anxious.1": "High. Too high. Don't slip.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.anxious.2": "Don't look down. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.coiled.1": "High. So what.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.coiled.2": "Up here, nobody bothers us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.grieving.1": "...Far from everything.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.high.grieving.2": "...Far from everything.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.content.1": "Warm. Almost too warm, but fine.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.content.2": "Hot... but you're here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.anxious.1": "Hot. Too hot. We'll melt. Won't we?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.anxious.2": "Burning? No. Not yet.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.coiled.1": "Hot. Get us out.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.coiled.2": "Sweating. Hate it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.grieving.1": "...Heat. I barely feel it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.hot.grieving.2": "...Heat. I barely feel it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.content.1": "Cold. Let me hold you warm.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.content.2": "Brr. We'll share the warmth.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.anxious.1": "Cold. Slow. We're slowing.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.anxious.2": "Freezing? Are we freezing?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.coiled.1": "Cold. Move.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.coiled.2": "Cold. Why are we here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.grieving.1": "...Cold. It matches.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.cold.grieving.2": "...Cold. It matches.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.content.1": "Water. Splash! Not too deep.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.content.2": "Wet, but we're together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.anxious.1": "Water. Heavy. Don't sink.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.anxious.2": "Don't go under. Please.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.coiled.1": "Wet. Ugh.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.coiled.2": "Water. Out. Now.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.grieving.1": "...Water. So still.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.water.grieving.2": "...Water. So still.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.content.1": "Little people! They're sweet.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.content.2": "Smells like bread. Be nice.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.anxious.1": "Little ones. Many. Be careful.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.anxious.2": "They stare. Why do they stare?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.coiled.1": "Loud. Small. Annoying.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.coiled.2": "Villagers. Leave them. Leave.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.grieving.1": "...Small lives. Fragile things.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.village.grieving.2": "...Small lives. Fragile things.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.content.1": "Monsters. Don't worry. I've got you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.content.2": "They want us? Let them try. Together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.anxious.1": "Monsters! Close. Too close.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.anxious.2": "Many. Many of them. Run?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.coiled.1": "Monsters. Finally.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.coiled.2": "Come on then.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.grieving.1": "...They'll come. They always do.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.monsters.grieving.2": "...They'll come. They always do.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.content.1": "Beasts. Gentle things. Let them be.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.content.2": "Oh, look at them. Content.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.anxious.1": "Beasts. Watching us. Watching.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.anxious.2": "They stare. Don't hurt them. Don't.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.coiled.1": "Beasts. Dumb. Loud.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.coiled.2": "Cattle. Ugh.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.grieving.1": "...Living things. Still here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.beasts.grieving.2": "...Living things. Still here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.content.1": "A friend of yours? Hello.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.content.2": "Someone like you. Be kind.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.anxious.1": "Another one. Do they see us?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.anxious.2": "Someone's here. Careful. Careful.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.coiled.1": "Another one. Tch.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.coiled.2": "Who is that. Why are they here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.grieving.1": "...Someone is here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.player.grieving.2": "...Someone is here.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.content.1": "A body. Shall we share it?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.content.2": "Ah. Dinner, if you'll let me.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.anxious.1": "A body. Is it still? Yes. Yes.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.anxious.2": "Dead? Safe to touch? Yes?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.coiled.1": "Dead. Good. Food.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.coiled.2": "Meat. Take it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.grieving.1": "...Another one gone.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.corpse.grieving.2": "...Another one gone.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.content.1": "Lava. Step back, please. For me.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.content.2": "Fire in the ground. Keep us safe.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.anxious.1": "LAVA. Careful. CAREFUL.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.anxious.2": "Fire! Away. Away.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.coiled.1": "Lava. Don't be stupid.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.coiled.2": "Fire. Keep away.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.grieving.1": "...Fire. I hate it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.lava.grieving.2": "...Fire. I hate it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.content.1": "Quiet. Peaceful. Just us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.content.2": "Nothing to do. Nice.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.anxious.1": "Too quiet. What's coming?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.anxious.2": "Quiet. Why is it quiet?",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.coiled.1": "Quiet. Boring.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.coiled.2": "Nothing. Wake me when.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.grieving.1": "...Quiet.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.see.quiet.grieving.2": "...Quiet.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.coiled.in.1": "It coils. Tight. Don't touch it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.coiled.in.2": "Leave us alone. We're wound too tight.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.anxious.in.1": "It fidgets. Something is wrong.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.anxious.in.2": "Uneasy. We feel uneasy.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.content.in.1": "Calm now. Warm.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.content.in.2": "Better. We feel better.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.grieving.downed": "...You nearly left us. You nearly left.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.grieving.near_death": "...So close. So close to nothing.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.grieving.pet": "...Your companion is gone.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.grieving.friend": "...One of yours is gone.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.stage.attached": "Attached. We are becoming one.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.stage.integrated": "Integrated. We move as one.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.stage.cooperative": "Cooperative. We work together.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.stage.dominant": "Dominant. We are whole.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.none": "At ease. We do as we like.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.protect.yes": "We'll guard you. Closely.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.hunt.yes": "Hunt. Freely. Good.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.hide.yes": "Hiding. We stay in.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.refuse.1": "No. We don't trust you enough.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.refuse.2": "Not yet. Earn it.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.sulk.1": "No. We're still angry with you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.sulk.2": "Not now. We're sore.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.defy": "We don't take orders from you any more.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.protect.shield.1": "Behind us.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.protect.shield.2": "Hardening. Stay close.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.meat.ask.1": "Meat. Raw. Feed us, and we'll love you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.meat.ask.2": "Hungry for something real. Bring meat.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.meat.nag": "We asked for meat.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.meat.last": "Last chance. Meat. NOW.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.meat.ignored": "You didn't feed us. We'll remember.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.kill.ask.1": "Give us something to kill.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.kill.ask.2": "We want a kill. Show us a threat.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.kill.nag": "A kill. We still want a kill.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.kill.last": "Kill something, or we will.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.kill.ignored": "Too slow. We'll do it ourselves.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.deep.ask.1": "Take us down. Deep. Stone all around.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.deep.ask.2": "We want the deep dark. Go down.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.deep.nag": "Down. We said down.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.deep.last": "Deeper. Now. Or we dig.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.deep.ignored": "No? Then we dig it ourselves.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.night.ask.1": "A night hunt. Under the open sky. With you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.night.ask.2": "Dark out. Let's hunt, under the stars.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.night.nag": "The night is wasting. Hunt.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.night.last": "The dark won't wait. HUNT.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.night.ignored": "The night passes. We hunt without you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.ask.1": "Wear us. Please. We want to be worn.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.ask.2": "Put us on. Let us cover you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.nag": "Wear us. We're waiting.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.last": "Wear us. Or we cover you ourselves.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.ignored": "You wouldn't. Then we cover you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.thanks.1": "Thank you. We remember.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.thanks.2": "Good. Yes. That was right.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.itself_done.1": "Done. We did it ourselves.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.itself_done.2": "There. We didn't need you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.hunt_itself.1": "Then we'll find one ourselves.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.hunt_itself.2": "We'll do the killing. Watch.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.req.worn.itself": "There. We cover you now.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.go.1": "Down. We're going down.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.go.2": "Stone. Dark. We'll show you.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.there.1": "Deep enough. Feel the dark. Yours again.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.there.2": "Here. Isn't it good? Take your body.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.blocked": "Something's in the way. Enough.",
	"message.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.dig.stuck": "Stuck. Enough of this.",
