	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.content.tip": "Warm and at ease. Kind lines.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.anxious.tip": "Wound up: stress, hunger or neglect. Nervous lines.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.coiled.tip": "Tightly wound. Short, sour lines.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.mood.grieving.tip": "Mourning a loss. It hardly speaks.",
