	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.hide": "Hide",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.none.tip": "No standing order. It does as it likes.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.protect.tip": "It guards you early: it fights for you well before you're low, and shields you when something's on you.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.hunt.tip": "It hunts freely: kills first, then feeds, on a lighter appetite.",
	"gui.jaymospowers.web_symbiote.order.hide.tip": "It holds back: suit and tendrils drawn in, far fewer takeovers, no gifts, no requests.",
